Origin
------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is a web rewrite of FuelTracker, an iOS and watchOS app by the same
copyright holder:

    https://github.com/kja031199/FuelTrackingApp

The domain logic here — the MPG segment algorithm, the missed-fill-up
detector, the unit conversions, the OCR text parsers, and the accessible
colour palette — is ported from that project, whose test suite serves as
this one's specification. The original remains under the same Apache-2.0
licence and the same copyright holder.

